    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the Calorie Calculator /ci_calorie_calculator/ folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the Calorie Calculator plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed leftover files of earlier plugin versions</li>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 7.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release of Calorie Calculator</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>Discover your ideal daily calorie intake with our Calorie Calculator. Find out exactly how many calories you need to eat to lose, maintain, or gain weight. <a href=\"https://www.calculator.io/calorie-calculator/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://www.calculator.io/calorie-calculator/</a></p>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<p>Add the Calorie Calculator shortcode to your page, post or sidebar:</p>\n<pre><code>[ci_calorie_calculator]\n</code></pre>\n<p>Add the following code to your template where you would like the Calorie Calculator to appear:</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;?php display_ci_calorie_calculator(); ?&gt;\n</code></pre>\n"
    },
